13", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_3068016830070746_1944741136029033866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V7rwBdQa6dsQ7kNvwGfXpB4&_nc_oc=Adpc5wLLfjRaYZOHJURO2szmZr9LDp_6hiEMHX3-dNlyZZU-s8EfuzaUEcV1x3TlB4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIWrMYKiCpdvQwO3eLoEyOVHIDceubQul0Vqw5R1MDdfA&oe=6AAE898D"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_065_0000.png", "id": "1805631137516612", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620875_1805631140849945_7857869342377884526_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xngpqx1GbsQQ7kNvwEsHuui&_nc_oc=AdqjWSayrdthJsD58r8sIpFwLlhWkYNdT9xc5Yd5-KHn--29m0i3vidGcrBxZVbDy_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL4zLEuvty6sTn8BC-snlAX3Ka1u_WiA3GShnllghfUSQ&oe=6AAEB102"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_005_0000.png", "id": "1592099439160214", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619404_1592099442493547_6642080100571952337_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YN9u2MqgamoQ7kNvwFbIKgG&_nc_oc=Adp2r1vB0Cf8s3MRL8XV3IJMy81CLUzodv0z13raJxiJmPuQrTqWwcMqqs8kGm22-2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKtS5pN4nlfhKTfkE9weSGW3_48ZdceEphDtwk8EVG3DQ&oe=6AAEAC2E"}, "display_name": "Ride: Fun Line Express", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Hop aboard this theme\u2011park\u2011style VR train ride and experience over 13 minutes of fun through a vibrant 3D world of candies, playful architecture, and animated surprises.\n\nThe train takes flight, gliding through rooms of bouncing balls, passing through Candy Lane air traffic, plunging into a thrilling 1000\u2011ft drop, and gliding across a massive 100\u2011ft wave in this fun, family\u2011friendly VR simulation experience. Take a break and enjoy a magical ride full of candies, colors, and fun.", "short_description": "Theme\u2011park\u2011style VR ride that ta